sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor P as Public Reporter
  actor C as Coordinator
  participant V as ReportView / DashboardView (FXML)
  participant CT as Report/DashboardController
  participant SC as ServerConnection
  participant H as ClientHandler (pool thread)
  participant D as RequestDispatcher
  participant DS as DisasterService
  participant CS as CoordinationService / PriorityCalculator
  participant DB as MySQL (DAOs)
  participant A as AuditService
  P->>V: fill form, click Submit Report
  V->>CT: submitReport()
  CT->>CT: validate fields (Validation)
  CT->>SC: send(Request REPORT_DISASTER) [background Task]
  SC->>H: serialised Request over TCP
  H->>D: handle(request)
  D->>D: session valid? AccessControl.isAllowed(REPORTER)
  D->>DS: report(user, type, location, ...)
  DS->>DS: sign canonicalContent with user's RSA key
  DS->>DB: INSERT disaster_reports (phone AES-encrypted)
  DB-->>DS: generated report_id
  DS->>A: record(REPORT_DISASTER) - hash chained + signed
  A->>DB: INSERT audit_log
  D-->>SC: Response.ok("Report #n submitted")
  SC-->>CT: response on FX thread
  CT-->>V: green status message, refresh My reports
  C->>V: select report, choose severity, Assess & Coordinate
  V->>CT: assess()
  CT->>SC: send(Request ASSESS_REPORT)
  SC->>H: Request
  H->>D: handle(request)
  D->>D: AccessControl.isAllowed(COORDINATOR)
  D->>DS: assess(user, reportId, severity)
  DS->>DB: BEGIN, SELECT ... FOR UPDATE
  DS->>CS: calculate(type, severity) → priority
  DS->>CS: coordinateResponse(report, departments)
  CS-->>DS: ResponseTask list (relevant departments)
  DS->>DB: INSERT response_tasks, UPDATE report, COMMIT
  DS->>A: record(ASSESS_REPORT)
  D-->>SC: Response.ok(priority, tasks created)
  SC-->>CT: response
  CT-->>V: refresh table and dashboard cards
